resources.string:
Use a file-backed search provider before entering a query.
-[provider] [search this...] -> use a provider from search.txt -add [provider] [url_template] -> add or replace a provider -rm [provider] -> remove a provider -ls -> list providers -file -> open search.txt -reset -> restore the default providers
Template tokens: {query}, {query+}, {slug}, {raw}, {url} Example: search -add sdw https://stardewvalleywiki.com/{slug}
